{"id": "15-403-2-10", "zh": "《词释藏》（Niruttipiṭaka）中说：“以动作为特征的是动词，它没有性别之分。”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-403-11-16", "zh": "这里，“没有性别之分”是什么意思？", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-403-17-26", "zh": "对阴性、阳性、中性没有区别，这个意思称为“没有性别之分”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-403-27-41", "zh": "例如“puriso gacchati（男人走）、kaññā gacchati（少女走）、cittaṃ gacchati（心走）”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-403-42-88", "zh": "在以四种方式列出的动词中，就像取 a 音之后接 ti 结尾的词“bhavati”，以“bhavati、bhavanti、bhavasi”等方式完整地作出动词词形表那样，也应当取“ubbhavati”等 a 音之后接 ti 结尾的词，以“ubbhavati、ubbhavanti、ubbhavasi”等方式完整地作出动词词形表。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-403-89-115", "zh": "但对于“bhoti、sambhoti”等 o 音之后接 ti 结尾的词，以及“bhāveti、vibhāveti”等 e 音之后接 ti 结尾的词，应当只依照圣典的用法来作词形表，而不是依照这里所说的方式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-403-116-121", "zh": "因为在这类地方，动词的变化很难了解。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-403-122-126", "zh": "所以应当按照实际能见到的形式来作动词词形表。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-403-127-155", "zh": "因为世间的人并不会把所有的词根词逐一与全部九十六个语尾结合起来说；他们即使不这样说，言谈也不算不完整。所以应当避开该避开的地方，按照可能出现的情况来作词形表。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-403-156-159", "zh": "在命令语尾（pañcamī）等其他语尾中也是这样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-403-160-163", "zh": "以上是依现在时语尾（vattamānā）所作的动词词形表说明。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-404-2-11", "zh": "从这里开始，应当把前面列出的那些词逐一变换，作为命令语尾等的纲目来理解。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "15-404-12-26", "zh": "现在我们将按照带与不带 ta、yo 等代词这两种方式来展示动词词形表，也展示某些由替换而产生的其他词形，为的是让听者容易记住，也为了在人们运用时不致混淆。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "15-405-2-5", "zh": "bhavatu，bhavantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-405-6-11", "zh": "bhavāhi、bhava，bhavatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-405-12-15", "zh": "bhavāmi，bhavāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-405-16-19", "zh": "bhavataṃ，bhavantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-405-20-23", "zh": "bhavassu，bhavavho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-405-24-27", "zh": "bhave，bhavāmase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-405-28-33", "zh": "他 bhavatu，他们 bhavantu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-405-34-41", "zh": "你 bhavāhi、bhava，你们 bhavatha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-405-42-47", "zh": "我 bhavāmi，我们 bhavāma。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-405-48-53", "zh": "他 bhavataṃ，他们 bhavantaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-405-54-59", "zh": "你 bhavassu，你们 bhavavho。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-405-60-65", "zh": "我 bhave，我们 bhavāmase。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-405-66-69", "zh": "以上是依命令语尾（pañcamī）所作的动词词形表说明。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-406-2-7", "zh": "bhaveyya、bhave，bhaveyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-406-8-11", "zh": "bhaveyyāsi，bhaveyyātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-406-12-17", "zh": "bhaveyyāmi，bhaveyyāma、bhavemu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-406-18-21", "zh": "bhavetha，bhaveraṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-406-22-25", "zh": "bhavetho，bhaveyyāvho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-406-26-40", "zh": "bhaveyyaṃ，bhaveyyāmhe；或者带代词：他 bhaveyya、bhave，他们 bhaveyyuṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "15-406-41-46", "zh": "你 bhaveyyāsi，你们 bhaveyyātha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-406-47-54", "zh": "我 bhaveyyāmi，我们 bhaveyyāma、bhavemu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-406-55-60", "zh": "他 bhavetha，他们 bhaveraṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-406-61-66", "zh": "你 bhavetho，你们 bhaveyyāvho。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-406-67-74", "zh": "我 bhaveyyaṃ，我们 bhaveyyāmhe。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-406-75-78", "zh": "以上是依祈愿语尾（sattamī）所作的动词词形表说明。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-407-2-5", "zh": "babhūva，babhūvu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-407-6-9", "zh": "babhūve，babhūvittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-407-10-13", "zh": "babhūvaṃ，babhūvimha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-407-14-17", "zh": "babhūvittha，babhūvire。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-407-18-21", "zh": "babhūvittho，babhūvivho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-407-22-33", "zh": "babhūviṃ，babhūvimhe；或者带代词：他 babhūva，他们 babhūvu。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "15-407-34-39", "zh": "你 babhūve，你们 babhūvittha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-407-40-45", "zh": "我 babhūvaṃ，我们 babhūvimha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-407-46-51", "zh": "他 babhūvittha，他们 babhūvire。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-407-52-57", "zh": "你 babhūvittho，你们 babhūvivho。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-407-58-65", "zh": "我 babhūviṃ，我们 babhūvimhe。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-407-66-69", "zh": "以上是依远过去时语尾（parokkhā）所作的动词词形表说明。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-408-2-5", "zh": "abhavā，abhavū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-408-6-9", "zh": "abhavo，abhavattha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-408-10-13", "zh": "abhavaṃ，abhavamhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-408-14-17", "zh": "abhavattha，abhavatthuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-408-18-21", "zh": "abhavase，abhavavhaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-408-22-33", "zh": "abhaviṃ，abhavamhase；或者带代词：他 abhavā，他们 abhavū。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "15-408-34-39", "zh": "你 abhavo，你们 abhavattha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-408-40-45", "zh": "我 abhavaṃ，我们 abhavamhā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-408-46-51", "zh": "他 abhavattha，他们 abhavatthuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-408-52-57", "zh": "你 abhavase，你们 abhavavhaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-408-58-65", "zh": "我 abhaviṃ，我们 abhavamhase。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-408-66-69", "zh": "以上是依昨日过去时语尾（hiyyattanī）所作的动词词形表说明。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-409-2-5", "zh": "abhavi，abhavuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-409-6-9", "zh": "abhavo，abhavittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-409-10-13", "zh": "abhaviṃ，abhavimhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-409-14-17", "zh": "abhavā，abhavū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-409-18-21", "zh": "abhavase，abhavivhaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-409-22-33", "zh": "abhavhaṃ，abhavimhe；或者带代词：他 abhavi，他们 abhavuṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "15-409-34-39", "zh": "你 abhavo，你们 abhavittha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-409-40-45", "zh": "我 abhaviṃ，我们 abhavimhā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-409-46-51", "zh": "他 abhavā，他们 abhavū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-409-52-57", "zh": "你 abhavase，你们 abhavivhaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-409-58-65", "zh": "我 abhavaṃ，我们 abhavimhe。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-409-66-69", "zh": "以上是依今日过去时语尾（ajjatanī）所作的动词词形表说明。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-410-2-11", "zh": "这里，由于今日过去时的 uṃ 语尾替换为 iṃsu，也应当了解 bhavati 的其他词形。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-410-12-13", "zh": "是哪些呢？", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-410-14-32", "zh": "他们 bhaviṃsu、samubbhaviṃsu、pabhaviṃsu、parābhaviṃsu、sambhaviṃsu、pātubhaviṃsu、pātubbhaviṃsu，这些是不及物的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-410-33-46", "zh": "paribhaviṃsu、abhibhaviṃsu、adhibhaviṃsu、atibhaviṃsu、anubhaviṃsu、samanubhaviṃsu、abhisambhaviṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-411-2-13", "zh": "因为“adhibhosuṃ”这个词形在圣典中也能见到，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-412-2-14", "zh": "所以“paribhosuṃ”等词形也应当依此类推来了解。", "confidence": 80}
